---
interface Props {
	variant?: "default" | "hero";
}

const { variant = "default" } = Astro.props;
---

<div class:list={["donation-cta", { "donation-cta--hero": variant === "hero" }]}>
	<a
		href="https://www.wownature.eu/areewow/parco-lombardo-della-valle-del-ticino/"
		target="_blank"
		rel="noreferrer"
		class="donation-link"
	>
		DONA UN ALBERO
	</a>
	<p>Quest'estate il ritmo non si ferma sul palco. Con il codice <b>LAVENOFEST20</b> adotti un albero su WOWnature con il <b>20%</b> di sconto: la colonna sonora della tua estate può anche far crescere un bosco</p>
</div>

<style>
	.donation-cta {
		margin-top: 2.15rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.donation-cta p {
		max-width: 31rem;
		margin: 0.9rem auto 0;
		font-family: var(--font-plex);
		font-size: 14px;
		line-height: 1.35;
	}

	.donation-link {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 1rem 0.75rem 0.8rem;
		border-radius: 18px;
		color: #fff;
		background: var(--page-green);
		font-family: var(--font-blur);
		font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 4.8vw, 1.55rem);
		line-height: 0.9;
		text-decoration: none;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		white-space: nowrap;
		transition: transform 180ms ease;
	}

	.donation-link:hover {
		transform: scale(1.04);
	}

	.donation-link:focus-visible {
		outline: 3px solid currentColor;
		outline-offset: 4px;
	}

	.donation-cta--hero {
		/* margin-top: clamp(1.75rem, 4vh, 2.75rem); */
		margin-top: 3.15rem;
		color: #fff;
		text-shadow: 0 0.18rem 0.8rem rgb(0 0 0 / 0.45);
	}

	.donation-cta--hero p {
		padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
		border-radius: 1.5rem;
		background: rgba(9, 50, 15, 0.635);
		box-shadow: 0 0.35rem 1rem rgba(24, 33, 25, 0.272);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(1px);
		backdrop-filter: blur(1px);
		text-shadow:
			0 0.1rem 0.25rem rgb(0 0 0 / 0.35);
	}

	.donation-cta--hero .donation-link {
		color: var(--page-green);
		background: #fff;
		box-shadow: 0 0.3rem 0.9rem rgb(0 0 0 / 0.25);
		text-shadow: none;
	}

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.donation-link {
			transition: none;
		}
	}
</style>
